00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:24.000
should change your mindset. And when it

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:26.479
comes to networking, I have kind of a

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:28.720
unfortunate truth. And the unfortunate

00:01:26.479 --> 00:01:31.280
truth about networking is that if you're

00:01:28.720 --> 00:01:33.119
not an expert at something, if you

00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:35.600
haven't done something, accomplished

00:01:33.119 --> 00:01:36.880
something,

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:41.400
networking is going to be damn near

00:01:36.880 --> 00:01:41.400
impossible because everybody's selfish.

