00:02:01.439 --> 00:02:05.360
something to add to the table.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:07.439
So, that's why everybody wants to talk

00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:08.560
to and know successful business owners

00:02:07.439 --> 00:02:10.720
